#: scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43302619563b6f9e305369a9af6abbbeb6fd1af3585de4739eee3c0f895478f6
#. default-sha256: a81468d0d7da0bf31e8a719fc1741a1e40227a3d10bf2dd5b357e258cae3c049
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This is something that actually happened to another maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Isso é algo que realmente aconteceu com outra criada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 026f7b843349b24d6e5f1e9bfff954121cec2c6c3a7c6b4318aa616c97ebf997
#. default-sha256: fc0505526d5cfba11d2e5532e8ee46d533d2f4e5841c7c8bd816d05639bfc433
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She heard a sound in the middle of the night.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A sound like dripping water."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela ouviu um som no meio da noite.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Um som como água pingando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3266b22e18bf8a10bab5e946e92606d09198bfaf060daa3ad3c2c9e8f981ebed
#. default-sha256: f8131321f0ddc5f54b8f1dc39adcf18dea3fd24047796e166559f097b550fbd0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At first, ⟪k:3⟫she thought it was raining, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫so she looked through the "
"window, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and there wasn’t a cloud in the sky to cover the stars."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Inicialmente, ⟪k:3⟫ pensou que estava chovendo, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫então ela olhou pela "
"janela, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫e não havia uma nuvem no céu para cobrir as estrelas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff12db5aabf8dbb3e041e7e98c7edb9b994935a43cd13d4b25297622e1b1929d
#. default-sha256: 437f64f853f1d3230e6caf97c7321df98a2fea8b11bee49d2e38581948003f5c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Maybe it’s a faucet,” ⟪k:1⟫she thought, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so she stepped out of her room and into "
"the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Talvez seja uma torneira,” ⟪k:1⟫ela pensou, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫então saiu e foi para o corredor."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b674f058166b73dcb3d813e6b1aa46054436669db444075fa51144b7aa6b252f
#. default-sha256: 1fc8c29f3c39e5d06cd36cda5877aa5f585ff9aa66a84a51b838f4b5f13703ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Compared to her room, ⟪k:1⟫it was unearthly chilly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The maid regretted not bringing "
"something to cover herself with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comparado ao seu quarto, ⟪k:1⟫estava sobrenaturalmente frio.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫A criada lamentou não "
"ter trazido algo para se cobrir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b71a6dfb61dd3ec7dac46ba3e92ab323918f67c744de8e972dbb683eb815935d
#. default-sha256: 89709b610f087155670ecc065a8e4f30dd5ee764d61bd36dfd2d265fe43ba4d4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t make any sense.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normally, ⟪k:3⟫the temperature wasn’t that much "
"colder outside her room. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Her nightclothes had always been more than enough for a trip "
"to the lavatory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas isso não fazia sentido.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normalmente, ⟪k:3⟫a temperatura não era muito mais fria "
"fora de seu quarto. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sua roupa de dormir sempre foi mais que suficiente para uma ida ao "
"banheiro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c31d064a374694dbc093acbb9227644e3a8c0f35e6a2d3c4944d335269915c90
#. default-sha256: 184feefe74ab3a445429a8f0530f7b0a228ac465c0b461dc8e37ab8a30b1891b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wondering what the reason could be,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she made her way toward the sound—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but then, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫she realized something:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se perguntando qual poderia ser o motivo,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ela seguiu o caminho em direção ao som—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫mas então, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ela percebeu algo:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e207b418737ed341a55da8233128e81f0f51f63a10805ed830cc8295f72cf432
#. default-sha256: b4712fb44f167dcca9774bdade11d20290a9e500d45d9274f5b661b893236eb5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were no faucets in the direction she was going.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Rather, ⟪k:4⟫she was "
"headed toward a hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não havia torneiras na direção em que ela estava indo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Em vez disso, ela "
"estava indo em direção a um salão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98b1ca820359d3e624efe14383120765174b661782ede3dd7c2a1fbb7b0ed189
#. default-sha256: 56ae4ae30c46c73fd30d3ec48a3bda7d87e4ac2f57b45acc421d7db3c65f1389
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion where she served had many halls,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but this one was off in a far "
"corner of the house—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫the least used hall of them all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A mansão onde ela servia tinha muitos salões,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mas este ficava em um canto "
"distante da casa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫o menos usado de todos eles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee98fc6aed27da0b3f73f2f564cdee2f91e66477a3b784e3fd5cc57c4e38d03b
#. default-sha256: b150690b48901b27495a44b39eb1df212c9b5f3ddde1f76ec2e586348b93aa67
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had a high roof, ⟪k:3⟫but not a lot of space, ⟪k:4⟫so it was difficult to make "
"good use of. ⟪k:5⟫It also had a somewhat heavy air to it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫a very curious room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tinha um teto alto, ⟪k:3⟫mas não muito espaço, ⟪k:4⟫por isso era difícil de fazer "
"bom uso. ⟪k:5⟫Também tinha um ar um tanto pesado—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫uma sala muito curiosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9c132a11a6dd8fae74abcc1fd1cf92511f6d5fb8c9d9a1909a9463ea7435780
#. default-sha256: 9ac1437eaafe784a972fe987f7baa86a7e045dede1e0d7634de5b8feb1dbbafd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the kind of place you might assign someone to clean as part of their hazing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era o tipo de lugar que você atribuiria para alguém limpar como parte de seu trote de "
"iniciação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c171493659b5fb9b509a20f897f48c484fda011580126dc127d26c979b952e5b
#. default-sha256: b269403f7d45caf5595cc0cc8ea7ddecede73688083aa74fcc77418f44b27a60
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anyway, ⟪k:1⟫when the maid realized the sound was coming from that particular hall, ⟪k:2⟫"
"she, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as you might expect, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫let out an uncomfortable sigh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De qualquer forma, ⟪k:1⟫quando a criada percebeu que o som estava vindo daquele salão em "
"particular, ⟪k:2⟫ela, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫como você poderia esperar, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ soltou um suspiro "
"desconfortável."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbbe732a727a2e047493e5d2f33fde456696313612f8acf940ea70679c6fb20b
#. default-sha256: 14bbb2bfca10293d032b563b5ef7c6fcb1f0df3da37158335b2510e8e1688ecf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there might be a leak, ⟪k:1⟫and having noticed, ⟪k:2⟫she couldn’t simply ignore it, ⟪k:3⟫"
"you know?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas podia haver um vazamento, ⟪k:1⟫e tendo notado, ⟪k:2⟫ela não poderia simplesmente ignorá-"
"lo, ⟪k:3⟫sabe?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 614150b26d38bc50d06e91a66e0923c213de00c88f22b707ae767e8f8265543a
#. default-sha256: a6df129db9d1b022549394d5fff2bb25285aea7337f22afb7cc235b3aa069fba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as much as she hesitated, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she pushed open the doors to the hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫por mais que hesitasse, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ela abriu as portas do salão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99da84e40c9cfbdc6e08baf6d48ae034279326dbf980d423765294bc8931b550
#. default-sha256: 119d4ceadeb18e8aa173d6258ddc0adf1339346ff42838a250dacdb8c1a8cabb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was nobody there, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and it didn’t look like anything was leaking, "
"⟪k:5⟫either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não havia ninguém lá, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e não parecia que algo estava vazando, ⟪k:5⟫também."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab18017576759bac5e6443c410cd6fe6acd39f7173feb30488f6788e090e9fe5
#. default-sha256: 4c20ac2c3ccf3cc4c7ac2bbe8feb28669998592b34143e98924e236d5f8f73da
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There were no puddles ⟪k:1⟫or water stains ⟪k:2⟫anywhere to be found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não havia poças ⟪k:1⟫ou manchas de água ⟪k:2⟫em qualquer lugar que pudesse ser encontrado."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 582a5dd21742e79f6c071ac1b84e18bbd38e51564747a80a20389eae0d6753d4
#. default-sha256: 9d8ec61a883bf062c75f649807def1441991a22d834f7a871dd9ae06c7b99f12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But she could still hear the sound, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫drip, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫drip⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫getting louder and louder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas ela ainda podia ouvir o som, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ping, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫ping⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫ficando cada vez mais alto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f78cab8de595397a16dc1ef3aabb9559492b9519189ece8717251e32b9cfe052
#. default-sha256: e4e2ee14c922f74b7eb1d628148c45031022d668a2f2dbb5e38957afacfcb6ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Slowly stepping further into the room, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫looking left, ⟪k:3⟫then right, ⟪k:4⟫then "
"left again, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she searched for the source of the sound, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫coming to a stop "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lentamente entrando na sala, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫olhando para a esquerda, ⟪k:3⟫depois para a direita, "
"⟪k:4⟫depois para a esquerda novamente, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ela procurou a fonte do som, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"parando no centro do salão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eef921e9a0f4efbb325f01cc0c1d6d31daf2aee00844aeac621a5104a28f907
#. default-sha256: e710b45faa6eeb4cc8b68fa8db3067d40314883dda10fe21bc3ae6974fe1c1f5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She stood there still, ⟪k:1⟫quiet, ⟪k:2⟫and then—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a chilly spot on the nape of her "
"neck."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela ficou ali parada, ⟪k:1⟫quieta, ⟪k:2⟫e então—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫um ponto frio na nuca."

#: scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bd4d91fb4a47ae143a39e35c107eecaa70a8c2cf6a65440528ef43cc09dcd13
#. default-sha256: b6bbacff24e022e857cdae0981a0e3fb1821d7ca328da06dddd7da1c30dfb5b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a little yelp, ⟪k:1⟫she reached back to feel her neck, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but it wasn’t wet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com um pequeno ganido, ⟪k:1⟫ela estendeu a mão para trás para sentir seu pescoço, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"mas não estava molhado."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ffb8adf416b9777551532b4dfc0a93474ab90e4c5ffa2c0afeac84e2c3f99b1
#. default-sha256: a4d4769a0752da1ff9ac9eec2cd60a250969e92e48c013d08635a6feeaf235b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Confused, ⟪k:1⟫she slowly, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫warily tilted her head backward..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Confusa, ⟪k:1⟫ela lentamente, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫cautelosamente, virou a cabeça para trás..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E1B1B5B_DE17_4A4D_A3AE_D65844474192
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78faef06b94b4047a376081a4e1d0242bd98c8dd83cee3aa285cee9f1f9632e7
#. default-sha256: 8befd8d20223821a550e54debbcd96056e323330cb7d922c2970c7e665b5f175
